/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[13]+ <-> Seventh[14]- (record
gforest:S7c8-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGforestS7c8nHX` and `wGforestS7c8nGX` (divided by `2
^ 20` and `2 ^ 33`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column;
the parts evaluate no word image. -/

